- A silent recording of this click path, with a caption for each step, is already in `submission/Demo_Backup_Manthan_Sankpal.mp4`. It was made by `python presentation/record_demo.py`, which drives the real dashboard.
- It differs from the live path in one place. On the Anomalies page it keeps the default window (July {{e:battledim.period.0|year}}), where leak {{a:water.residual_zscore.test.per_label.1.event_id}} ({{a:water.residual_zscore.test.per_label.1.type}}) starts on {{a:water.residual_zscore.test.per_label.1.start|date}} and is flagged {{a:water.residual_zscore.test.per_label.1.delay_hours|.0f}} hours later.
